{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに今日！\n乃木坂４６デビュー３周年を迎えることが出来ました～'٩꒰｡•◡•｡꒱۶'"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これまでの道のりは長かったようで本当にあっという間でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなことがあったなぁ～..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ティッシュ配りや、イオンモールなど地方を回るイベントから始まって..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ついに念願のドーム！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西武ドームに立たせていただき約３万8０００人もの方にお越しいただいて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャン！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この真冬の寒い中全曲披露と言うことで７時間強のライブでした..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーと終わる頃には寒すぎたりして人居なくなるんじゃない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言ってたのですが終わりも無事沢山の皆様に見守ってもらいぶじ終わりを迎えることができました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリジナルの衣装なので真夏の衣装着るときは寒かったなぁ～..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもみなさん見てると寒さよりも楽しさとかがいっぱいでしたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もわたし達のケーキは秒でなくなりましたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(๑>ᴗ<๑)ﾃﾍｯ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全メンバーの誕生日を祝うので毎月わりとケーキ食べれるのですが乃木坂はいつになっても甘いもの好きは変わらず\n毎回ケーキは秒でなくなります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回通してまた乃木坂が大好きになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直くじけそうになったことなんて山ほどあるし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人の相談にはよく乗るんだけど自分が相談するのは\nなんかまあやらしくないっていうか...\nらしくって、なにかよくわかんないけど‥\nまあやの性格的になかなか自分の悩んでることとか言えなくて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今回のライブはメンバーにも友達にも！そしてファンの方々に支えられました。\n笑顔でステージに立てるのは皆が居てくれるからです。\nタオルや団扇、声援やサイリウムそして、笑顔をくれてありがとうございました。\n大丈夫かな⁉︎\n寒かったから風邪ひかないでね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカパーで見てくださった方、応援ありがとうございました。\n気持ちは一緒だから\n一緒にお祝い出来て嬉しい～^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松井玲奈さんも一緒に参加出来たし、\nこじ坂の小嶋陽菜さんも来てくれました～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こじ坂は どうでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB４８さんの方のリクアワがこじはるさんと出来るのが最後かなぁ？とか当分できないかなぁ？\nとか思ってたけどよかったぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に盛り沢山でアッとゆう間に時間が過ぎました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月にアンダーライブも決定したよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてなによりも嬉しかったのは研究生が正規メンバーになったこと～ヾ(๑⃙⃘´ꇴ｀๑⃙⃘)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまあやもよりいっそう頑張らなきゃって、思えたよ～'٩꒰｡•◡•｡꒱۶'"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サプライズも沢山あったけどよくまあやには理解できませんでしたっ(๑>ᴗ<๑)ﾃﾍｯ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またメンバーやスタッフさん、ファンの方が一体になって熱いステージにまたなれるように頑張ります。\n一緒に思い出をつくりしょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にみんなが居なかったらここまでこれませんでした！ありがとうございました！\n四年目もどうぞ宜しくお願いします\n＼_(･ω･`)ｺｺ重要!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"٩(๑♥ڡ♥๑)۶(*´ω(ω`ｏ ))) ﾁｭｯ♪BYE"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/23/6264381/0022.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}